SOL 101
CEND
TITLE = RBE3 RX WEIGHTED C123 C23
ECHO = NONE
DISP = ALL
LOAD = 1
SPC = 1
BEGIN BULK
$
$
$ Goal:
$   Recover reference-grid R1 from independent T2/T3 displacements.
$
$ Why two independent sets:
$   * Grids 1-4 use weight 1.0 with C=123.
$     This keeps solvers that dislike missing component 1 from flagging the RBE3
$     element as singular.
$   * Grids 11-14 use weight 9.0 with C=23.
$     This is the high-weight part of the same physical unit R1 motion, but it
$     deliberately omits component 1.
$
$ Correct behavior:
$   Both independent sets prescribe the same pure unit rotation about X:
$
$     T2 = -z
$     T3 =  y
$
$   Therefore the weighted average rotation should be exactly:
$
$     grid 100, R1 = 1.0
$
$
$ A separate loaded CROD on grids 300-301 exists only so static solvers that
$ require at least one free analysis DOF do not stop with "no independent
$ degrees of freedom". It is disconnected from the RBE3 check.
$
PARAM,GRDPNT,100
$
$ Low-weight C=123 set.
GRID,1,,0.,-1.,0.
GRID,2,,0.,1.,0.
GRID,3,,0.,0.,-1.
GRID,4,,0.,0.,1.
$
$ High-weight C=23 set at the same physical positions.
GRID,11,,0.,-1.,0.
GRID,12,,0.,1.,0.
GRID,13,,0.,0.,-1.
GRID,14,,0.,0.,1.
$
GRID,100,,0.,0.,0.
GRID,200,,1.,0.,0.
GRID,300,,10.,0.,0.
GRID,301,,11.,0.,0.
MAT1,1,1.,,0.3,1.
PROD,1,1,1.
CROD,91,1,1,2
CROD,92,1,3,4
CROD,93,1,11,12
CROD,94,1,13,14
CROD,98,1,100,200
CROD,99,1,300,301
RBE3    10              100     4       1.      123     1       2       +
+       3       4       9.      23      11      12      13      14
$
$ Low-weight set displacements: T2=-z, T3=y.
SPC,1,1,12456,0.
SPC,1,1,3,-1.
SPC,1,2,12456,0.
SPC,1,2,3,1.
SPC,1,3,13456,0.
SPC,1,3,2,1.
SPC,1,4,13456,0.
SPC,1,4,2,-1.
$
$ High-weight set displacements: same unit R1 motion.
SPC,1,11,12456,0.
SPC,1,11,3,-1.
SPC,1,12,12456,0.
SPC,1,12,3,1.
SPC,1,13,13456,0.
SPC,1,13,2,1.
SPC,1,14,13456,0.
SPC,1,14,2,-1.
$
$ Reference grid 100: leave R1 dependent on the RBE3.
SPC,1,100,12356,0.
$
$ Dummy support grid for the harmless CROD connected to grid 100.
SPC,1,200,123456,0.
$
$ Unrelated loaded one-DOF rod, included only to keep a nonempty static A-set.
SPC,1,300,23456,0.
SPC,1,301,123456,0.
FORCE,1,300,,1.,1.,0.,0.
ENDDATA
